{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140180/extras/b3dfa7aaa535be48bbf58952c3eb5fb7.poster.avif?t=1773147577\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140180/extras/b3dfa7aaa535be48bbf58952c3eb5fb7.webm?t=1773147577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140180/extras/b3dfa7aaa535be48bbf58952c3eb5fb7.mp4?t=1773147577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THYSIASTERY</strong> is a turn-based, dungeon crawling roguelike role-playing game rendered in a retro-inspired art style.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a group of bearers of the <i>Brand</i> that have been drawn into the vast and enigmatic <i>Labyrinth</i>. Save, ally with, rely on and learn from characters you encounter whilst exploring in hopes of finding a way out. Discover buried forests, underwater cities and other ancient secrets as you delve deeper into the Labyrinth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140180/extras/6a69c1f6388ea9e9e20a385d6e17bbf4.avif?t=1773147577\" width=700 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>The Brand has called you in.    </i></strong> <br><strong><i>The Labyrinth hungers once more.\u00a0</i></strong> <br><strong><i>Or is it all just a sign of madness?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140180/extras/d2932fecff5bb2f475d6bfe8cdcf6e01.poster.avif?t=1773147577\" width=1170 height=632 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140180/extras/d2932fecff5bb2f475d6bfe8cdcf6e01.webm?t=1773147577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140180/extras/d2932fecff5bb2f475d6bfe8cdcf6e01.mp4?t=1773147577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140180/extras/6a69c1f6388ea9e9e20a385d6e17bbf4.avif?t=1773147577\" width=700 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140180/extras/8d9e7ba2ae9884c51ab76491a806c03c.poster.avif?t=1773147577\" width=1170 height=632 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140180/extras/8d9e7ba2ae9884c51ab76491a806c03c.webm?t=1773147577\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140180/extras/8d9e7ba2ae9884c51ab76491a806c03c.mp4?t=1773147577\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Turn-based combat in which your choices allow you to capitalize on chance and weakness - or be similarly exploited.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Classic roguelike features such as permadeath, procedurally generated areas and randomly generated characters that provide a highly replayable game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A great number of skills for characters to learn and discover, then teach further to other characters. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore different environments, investigate mysterious objects and artifacts, and meet some of the friendly natives of the Labyrinth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A number of difficulty modifiers to amp up or down the difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Beautiful retro-inspired art style drawn in limited color palettes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3140180/extras/6a69c1f6388ea9e9e20a385d6e17bbf4.avif?t=1773147577\" width=700 height=82 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"No discharge from the war","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3140180/7d8f44de3deed828c3a198a1ed04966be93c4f68.jpg"},{"name":"Primo Victoria","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3140180/08f2dd74ba27ae5cfd51f99ada574fa74d04ffb6.jpg"},{"name":"Living on a Prayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3140180/972cb50cbdbbeb09e80f7288401455a71163b985.jpg"},{"name":"Thy Will Be Done","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3140180/99bf2d642d6cd7d7d60463bc82bcbc590dae7a00.jpg"},{"name":"Master of One","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3140180/f713867a834ba6c705f3f6de93bc46226f65c8cc.jpg"},{"name":"Sharing is Caring","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3140180/7c7446d1c8ddbf3c636c084c6c8f01bb92b8e3ac.jpg"},{"name":"Unimportant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3140180/080d2014aafff48295d389d23e6d9f68fe833081.jpg"},{"name":"No Stone Unturned","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3140180/f2cca3e1a523fe6fa796d8785d2b1e06426f0340.jpg"},{"nam